    "text": "By Mary-Margaret Ellison ,\n5 hours ago HORRY COUNTY, SC (WMBF) - Horry County Schools leaders are sounding the alarm over growing concerns of vaping on school campuses. It has been a concern for years in Horry County and nationwide, but the growing concern now is how powerful and easily accessible it is for kids to get their hands on a vape. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
